{"id": "DF01", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的员工手册，入职满 1 年的员工，年假为 5 天 [1]。\n\n引用：\n[1] 员工手册（Demo 知识库）", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1975, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF02", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的员工手册，事假需提前 2 天向直属主管申请 [1]。", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1759, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF03", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的员工手册，病假返岗后需在3个工作日内补交医院诊断证明或医嘱 [1]。  \n\n引用来源：[1]", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1797, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF04", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的员工手册，加班申请调休后，调休额度须在当季度内使用完毕 [1]。\n\n引用来源：[1]", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md", "IT支持手册.md", "报销制度.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1828, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF05", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，公司每年为每位员工提供不低于 **20 小时** 的内部培训课程，覆盖制度、技能与团队协作。[1]", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md", "差旅政策.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1862, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF06", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，出差产生的交通和住宿费用报销标准如下：\n\n- **交通费**：实报实销，凭发票报销 [2]。\n- **住宿费**：一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）上限 500 元/晚，其他城市上限 350 元/晚，超出部分自理 [2][3]。\n- **报销时限**：出差结束后 3 个工作日内于 OA 系统提交发票 [1][2]。\n- **报销流程**：在 OA 填写报销单并上传发票 → 部门负责人审批 → 财务审核发票合规性 → 打款至员工工资卡 [2]。\n\n此外，若发票丢失，需补开或出具情况说明，经部门负责人签字 [2]。出租车费用凭行程单实报实销，单日上限 200 元 [2][3]。\n\n[1][2][3]", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md", "IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2649, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF07", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，办公设备（如电脑、打印机等）故障报修需通过邮件提交工单至 it-support@company.com，并注明设备编号。IT 部门将在工作日 1 小时内响应 [1]。\n\n引用来源：[1]", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "报销制度.md", "员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2204, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF08", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，办公区打印机为无线打印，员工持工牌在打印终端刷卡取件；在浏览器上传文件即可发起打印。[1]\n\n引用来源：[1]", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "报销制度.md", "产品FAQ.txt", "员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2305, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF09", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，员工离职后 VPN 账号会即时回收 [1]。  \n\n引用来源：[1]", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "员工手册.md", "报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2151, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF10", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，新员工入职当天，IT 会自动开通以下账号：企业邮箱、内部 VPN、IAM 账号 [1]。", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "员工手册.md", "报销制度.md", "产品FAQ.txt", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2168, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF11", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，LightCube 3.0 数据中台的默认网关并发为 500 请求/秒，且可按需水平扩容 [1]。\n\n引用来源：\n[1] LightCube 3.0 数据中台 产品 FAQ", "sources": ["产品FAQ.txt", "IT支持手册.md", "员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2383, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF12", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，LightCube 3.0 支持 Docker 单容器部署和 Kubernetes 集群部署两种方式 [1]。\n\n引用：\n[1] 部署方式支持 Docker 单容器部署；支持 Kubernetes 集群部署；提供 2.x → 3.0 数据迁移指令。", "sources": ["产品FAQ.txt", "IT支持手册.md", "员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2285, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF13", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，LightCube 3.0 数据中台内置的安全能力包括：角色权限控制、数据脱敏、操作审计日志 [1]。\n\n引用来源 [1]", "sources": ["产品FAQ.txt", "IT支持手册.md", "报销制度.md", "员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1991, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC01", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，出差需提前 2 天在 OA 系统提交出差申请 [1]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md", "报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1878, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC02", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，跨日出差需报备人事部门 [1]。\n\n引用：\n[1] 差旅政策（Demo 知识库：docs 库）", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md", "员工手册.md", "IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2016, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC03", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，紧急出差可先出行后补流程，但需在返程后 3 个工作日内补交相关申请 [1]。\n\n引用来源：[1]", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md", "员工手册.md", "IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1934, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC04", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的差旅政策，乘坐飞机出差需选择经济舱，且提前 7 天订票可享折扣价 [1]。  \n\n引用来源：[1]", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md", "报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1975, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC05", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，单次出差默认不超过 7 天，超出需特批 [1]。\n\n引用：\n[1] 出差时长与请假：单次出差默认不超过 7 天，超出需特批。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md", "报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2008, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC06", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的差旅政策，法定节假日出差按加班计算 [1]。\n\n引用来源：[1]", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md", "报销制度.md", "产品FAQ.txt", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2103, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC07", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，出租车费用凭行程单实报实销，单日上限 200 元 [1][2]。报销时需在出差结束后 3 个工作日内于 OA 系统提交发票 [1][2]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2184, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC08", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，交通费报销标准为实报实销，需凭发票报销 [1]。同时，打车费可凭行程单实报实销，单日上限为200元 [1][2]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2154, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC09", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的报销制度，发票丢失需补开或出具情况说明，经部门负责人签字后处理 [1]。同时，差旅政策中未提及发票丢失的具体处理方式，但报销凭证要求需在出差结束后3个工作日内于OA系统提交发票 [3][4]。若涉及紧急情况，可联系财务加急处理 [1]。\n\n引用：[1][3][4]", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md", "差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2653, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC10", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，报销被驳回的常见原因包括：发票抬头错误、超出标准、缺少明细 [1]。  \n\n引用来源：[1]", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md", "员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2146, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC11", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，紧急报销可联系财务加急，1 个工作日内处理 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md", "IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2344, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC12", "type": "direct", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，电子发票支持 PDF 与截图上传 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md", "员工手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1920, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF14", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，入职满 1 年的员工可享受 5 天年假 [1]。申请年假需提前 3 个工作日通过 OA 系统提交，并经部门负责人审批后生效 [1]。\n\n引用：[1]", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2339, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF15", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，入职满2年及以上的员工年假为10天，最高累计20天。因此，年假最多可累计20天 [1]。\n\n引用：\n[1] 员工手册（Demo 知识库）", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md", "产品FAQ.txt", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2125, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF16", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，请病假返岗后需在3个工作日内补交医院诊断证明或医嘱 [1]。", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md", "产品FAQ.txt", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1731, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF17", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "打印机故障可通过邮件 it-support@company.com 提交工单，需注明设备编号，IT 部门会在工作日 1 小时内响应 [1]。", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "报销制度.md", "员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2112, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF18", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，密码重置需在 IAM 系统自助完成，重置后 24 小时内生效 [1]。知识库中未提及具体重置所需时长，仅说明生效时限。若连续输错 5 次密码被锁号，需联系 IT 部门解锁 [1]。\n\n引用：[1]", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "报销制度.md", "员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2116, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF19", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，出差结束后需在 **3 个工作日内** 提交出差总结 [1]。同时，出差相关的交通、住宿费用报销也需在出差结束后 3 个工作日内于 OA 系统提交发票 [1][2][3]。\n\n引用：\n[1] 差旅政策（Demo 知识库：docs 库）\n[2] 员工手册（Demo 知识库）\n[3] 报销制度（Demo 知识库：docs 库）", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md", "报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2343, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF20", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，LightCube 3.0 数据中台兼容的数据源支持 19 种，包括 MySQL、PostgreSQL、Kafka、SQL Server、Oracle、Hive、Redis、MongoDB、Elasticsearch 等 [1]。", "sources": ["产品FAQ.txt", "IT支持手册.md", "员工手册.md", "报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1844, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF21", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，报销单需在 **OA 系统** 中填写并上传发票 [1]。具体流程为：员工在 OA 填写报销单并上传发票，经部门负责人审批、财务审核后打款至工资卡 [1]。\n\n引用来源 [1]", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "员工手册.md", "IT支持手册.md", "差旅政策.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2075, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC13", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的信息，去杭州（一线城市）出差的餐饮补贴标准为 **150 元/天** [1][2][3]。\n\n引用：\n- [1] 差旅政策：一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）：150 元/天。\n- [2] 员工手册：出差至一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）：伙食补贴 150 元/天。\n- [3] 报销制度：餐饮费一线城市 150 元/天。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md", "报销制度.md", "产品FAQ.txt", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2200, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC14", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据差旅政策，飞机票需提前 7 天订票可享折扣价 [1]。  \n\n引用：  \n[1] 差旅政策（Demo 知识库：docs 库）", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md", "报销制度.md", "产品FAQ.txt", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1930, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC15", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，出差住宿标准为：一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）500元/晚，其他城市350元/晚，需凭发票实报实销，超出部分自理 [1][2][3]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1695, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC16", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的报销制度，培训费每年有2000元的额度，适用于部门内培训 [1]。\n\n引用来源：[1]", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md", "IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1778, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC17", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，出差期间周六日不计加班 [1]，法定节假日出差按加班计算 [1]。因此，出差赶上周末干活不算加班，但如果是法定节假日出差则按加班计算。\n\n引用来源：[1]", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md", "报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1895, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC18", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的规定，出差结束后需在 **3 个工作日内** 于 OA 系统提交发票 [1][2][3]。  \n若为紧急出差后补流程，也需在返程后 3 个工作日内补交 [3]。  \n\n引用来源：  \n[1] 报销时限：出差结束后 3 个工作日内于 OA 系统提交发票  \n[2] 报销凭证：出差交通、住宿费用实报实销，需在出差结束后 3 个工作日内于 OA 系统提交发票  \n[3] 紧急出差可先出行后补流程，但需在返程后 3 个工作日内补交", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md", "IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2178, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
